Ocean's Delight for Horizon 26.3 (version 1.0.2-horizon.3)

A port of Ocean's Delight fdrf-fabric-1.0.2-1.20 by Scouter.
Original source: https://github.com/Scouter456/Oceans_Delight
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: a content package (no code). The items, blocks, textures, models and data
are carried over from the original jar and converted to Horizon's content format. Its cooking pot and
cutting board recipes, its guardian soup feast and its loot run on the farmersdelight package
(Farmer's Delight for Horizon) 0.5 or later, which it needs. This port is distributed under the same
licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.

The jar's fabric.mod.json names MIT; the licence file in the jar (LICENSE_oceansdelight, kept here as
LICENSE-CC0) and the 1.20 Fabric branch's file are the CC0 1.0 text of the Fabric template. This port
uses MIT, which either allows; LICENSE is the MIT text with the author's name.
